      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen that never will. everything is so heavy and loud in my head but at the same time i feel nothing at all. i just wish there was a way to make the emptiness go away for good. like, a way to finally just be still and not have to fight this grayness every single morning. i'm just so tired of existing like this.",
